1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,190
NVIDIA's board has reinstated Jensen Huang

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:04,290
as CEO, CNN reports

3
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:05,990
He had stepped down on November 12

4
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:07,830
The board says it is satisfied with his candor

5
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:09,830
and his ability to lead the company

6
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:11,810
NVIDIA says senior levels of the US government

7
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:15,590
assured it that his return poses no national security risk

8
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:17,190
President Trump backed the move hours before

9
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:18,370
the announcement

10
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:20,510
And the market answered: NVIDIA shares rose

11
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:22,650
more than 30 percent on Monday

12
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:24,450
Huang says he is honored to return

13
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:26,710
And the board's investigation is continuing

14
00:00:26,760 --> 00:00:27,670
Now my view

15
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:29,810
When Jensen resigned, I said on this channel

16
00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:31,830
that the industry had lost its most important

17
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:35,130
leader over a private matter, a loss we didn't need

18
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:37,150
Today, common sense prevailed

19
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:39,690
He built the world's largest company from scratch

20
00:00:39,740 --> 00:00:42,290
and we need him leading NVIDIA through this AI era

21
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:44,950
I hope he's learned from the scandal and comes back stronger

22
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:46,770
Judging by how NVIDIA's shares jumped on the

23
00:00:46,820 --> 00:00:48,330
news, the markets think so too
